# Code owners
#
# GitHub asks the owner of a path for a review when a pull request changes it.
# With the branch protection rule "Require review from Code Owners" the pull
# request cannot be merged without that review.
#
# The difference list of the golden tests (docs/run-testing.md): a row is an
# accepted difference between the recorded behaviour and today's. The product
# owner signs a row by approving the pull request that adds the signature;
# scripts/check-difference-signatures.js fails a signature without that review.
# The check reads the owner from this file on the target branch, so this file
# and the check are owned by the same person.
/server/tests/golden/differences.json @Intradmin
/scripts/check-difference-signatures.js @Intradmin
/.github/CODEOWNERS @Intradmin
